---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Get your entry QR code
eleventyComputed:
  description: "Get your QR code for {{ site.name }} {{ site.year }}."
permalink: /qr/
pageCss: [qr]
pageJs: [qr]
---
{%- from "partials/gilt.njk" import frame, laurel, mark -%}
{#- The QR page (4 October; working since 13 October, docs/QR.md). A delegate types the email
    they registered with; src/js/qr.js asks /api/pass.php, which asks the check-in app (18
    October), then draws their QR code, fills in their name, committee, allocation and committee
    page, and offers it as an image or a PDF to print (src/js/pass-pdf.js). Until the check-in
    app is connected and the Secretariat opens passes, the answer is "not open yet". The text is
    in site.json qrPage. -#}
{%- from "partials/icons.njk" import icon -%}
{%- from "partials/buttons.njk" import shine -%}
{%- set q = site.qrPage -%}
{#- The switch (21 October): site.json qrPage.open. Off, the form is greyed out with the
    "opening soon" note, and /api/pass.php refuses too (src/api-settings.njk). -#}
{%- set open = q.open === true -%}

<section class="qr">
  <div class="orb qr__orb" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  {{ frame("corner") }}
  {{ laurel("laurel--head") }}
  <div class="container qr__grid">
    <div class="qr__copy">
      <h1 class="t-page qr__title" data-reveal="mask">{{ q.title }}</h1>
      <p class="qr__intro" data-reveal>{{ q.intro }}</p>
      <form class="qr__form{% if not open %} is-closed{% endif %}" data-reveal data-qr-form data-pdf="/js/pass-pdf.js"{% if not open %} data-closed{% endif %} novalidate>
        <label class="qr__label" for="qr-email">Registration email</label>
        <div class="qr__row">
          <input class="qr__input" id="qr-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required aria-describedby="qr-note"{% if not open %} disabled{% endif %}>
          <button class="btn btn--shiny{% if not open %} is-disabled{% endif %}" type="submit"{% if not open %} disabled{% endif %}>{{ shine() }}<span class="qr__spin" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{ q.button }}</button>
        </div>
        <p class="qr__note" id="qr-note">{{ q.note if open else q.closedNote }}</p>
        <p class="qr__status" id="qr-status-text" role="status" data-qr-status></p>
        {#- One email, more than one delegate (22 October): a button for each name. -#}
        <div class="qr__choices" role="group" aria-labelledby="qr-status-text" hidden data-qr-choices></div>
      </form>
      {#- Good to know (23 October): shared parent emails, and who to email for help. -#}
      {%- if q.help %}
      <aside class="qr__help" aria-labelledby="qr-help-title" data-reveal>
        <h2 class="qr__help-title" id="qr-help-title">{{ q.help.title }}</h2>
        <ul class="qr__help-list">
          {%- for item in q.help.items %}
          <li>{{ item }}</li>
          {%- endfor %}
          {#- The conference's email (site.contact.email), then anyone in help.contacts. -#}
          {%- set contacts = [{ email: site.contact.email }].concat(q.help.contacts or []) %}
          <li>{{ q.help.contact }}
            {%- for c in contacts %}{{ " or" if loop.last and not loop.first else ("," if not loop.first) }} <a href="mailto:{{ c.email }}">{{ c.label or c.email }}</a>{% if c.role %} ({{ c.role }}){% endif %}{% endfor %} {{ q.help.contactEnd }}</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
      {%- endif %}
    </div>
    {#- The pass: the QR code, then who it belongs to. Before a search each value is a quiet
        dash (qrPage.messages.empty; 23 October, "TBC" looked unfinished). -#}
    {#- While a lookup runs the card is a pulsing skeleton (is-loading); a pass then settles in
        (is-found). src/js/qr.js, 26 October. -#}
    <div class="qr__card" data-reveal="art" data-qr-card>
      <div class="qr__code">
        <span class="qr__frame" data-qr-code aria-hidden="true">{{ icon("qr-code") }}</span>
        <span class="qr__placeholder" data-qr-placeholder>{{ q.placeholder }}</span>
        <div class="qr__saves" hidden data-qr-saves>
          <a class="btn btn--outline qr__save" download="oakjmun-pass.png" href="#" data-qr-save>{{ q.save }}</a>
          <button class="btn btn--outline qr__save" type="button" data-qr-pdf>{{ q.pdf.button }}</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="qr__details">
        <h2 class="qr__details-title">{{ q.detailsTitle }}</h2>
        <dl class="qr__list">
          {%- for d in q.details %}
          <div class="qr__field"{% if d.optional %} hidden data-qr-optional{% endif %}>
            <dt>{{ d.label }}</dt>
            <dd class="is-empty" data-qr-field="{{ d.key }}">{{ q.messages.empty }}</dd>
          </div>
          {%- endfor %}
          <div class="qr__field">
            <dt>{{ q.link.label }}</dt>
            <dd class="is-empty" data-qr-field="link">{{ q.messages.empty }}</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
        <p class="qr__details-note">{{ q.detailsNote }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  {#- Committee names and pages, for the "Your link" line. -#}
  {%- set pages = [] -%}
  {%- for c in committees %}{% set pages = (pages.push({ code: c.code, name: c.name, url: "/committees/" ~ c.slug ~ "/" }), pages) %}{% endfor %}
  <script type="application/json" data-qr-committees>{{ pages | dump | safe }}</script>
  <script type="application/json" data-qr-messages>{{ q.messages | dump | safe }}</script>
  {%- set pdfWords = { site: site.name ~ " " ~ site.year, title: q.pdf.title, instruction: q.pdf.instruction, note: q.pdf.note, when: (site.start | eventDates(site.end)) ~ " · " ~ site.venueShort } %}
  <script type="application/json" data-qr-pdf-words>{{ pdfWords | dump | safe }}</script>
</section>
